ast its door (the hat room's mirror and hats' floor, the bags, the broom stand); one bedroom built, the host's, off the landing between it and the hat room; reserved: the other two, either side of it along the landing (their floors and their doors off it, kept clear of everything; built later, the landing run out to them).",
